/T (10. Conclusion   In conclusion, the NearBuy application presented in this project provides an efficient and user-friendly solution for local shopping and delivery needs. By connecting customers with nearby shops through a single mobile platform, the system simplifies the process of finding products, placing orders, and choosing between home delivery or direct shop pickup. This approach significantly reduces the time and effort required for traditional shopping while improving overall convenience. )
/E (10. Conclusion   In conclusion, the NearBuy application presented in this project provides an efficient and user-friendly solution for local shopping and delivery needs. By connecting customers with nearby shops through a single mobile platform, the system simplifies the process of finding products, placing orders, and choosing between home delivery or direct shop pickup. This approach significantly reduces the time and effort required for traditional shopping while improving overall convenience. )
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
endobj
2434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 534 0 R
/T (The system also plays an important role in supporting local businesses by offering them a digital platform to manage products, handle orders, and reach nearby customers without investing in complex infrastructure. By integrating delivery agents into the system, NearBuy ensures reliable order fulfillment while creating flexible employment opportunities. This collaboration between users, shops, and delivery personnel enhances the efficiency of local commerce. )
/E (The system also plays an important role in supporting local businesses by offering them a digital platform to manage products, handle orders, and reach nearby customers without investing in complex infrastructure. By integrating delivery agents into the system, NearBuy ensures reliable order fulfillment while creating flexible employment opportunities. This collaboration between users, shops, and delivery personnel enhances the efficiency of local commerce. )
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
endobj
2435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
