/P 534 0 R
/T (Overall, the NearBuy application promotes smarter and faster local shopping while strengthening the connection between customers and local businesses. With the possibility of future enhancements such as improved recommendations, advanced security, and loyalty programs, the system has strong potential to evolve into a scalable and sustainable local commerce platform that benefits both users and small businesses. )
/E (Overall, the NearBuy application promotes smarter and faster local shopping while strengthening the connection between customers and local businesses. With the possibility of future enhancements such as improved recommendations, advanced security, and loyalty programs, the system has strong potential to evolve into a scalable and sustainable local commerce platform that benefits both users and small businesses. )
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
